OL,3,AIsraeli strikes in southern Lebanese
OL,4,Avillage kill 12
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Israeli military said it struck
OL,7,Finfrastructure sites belonging to the
OL,8,FShia Muslim armed group Hezbollah, as
OL,9,Fwell as "several terrorists"
OL,10,Ftransferring weapons, in retaliation
OL,11,Ffor a drone attack on troops in an
OL,12,Foccupied area of the country.
OL,14,FIsraeli attacks across southern Lebanon
OL,15,Fhave killed at least 27 people over the
OL,16,Fpast three days, according to the
OL,17,Fhealth ministry.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
